    "滤波算法"
  ],
  "createdAt": "2026-08-26T12:52:08.021Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-08-26T12:53:10.178Z",
  "assets": [],
  "html": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(32, 33, 34);\">也称α-β滤波器、fg 滤波器。</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87);\">这个滤波器是许多其他滤波器的基础，包括卡尔曼滤波器。换句话说，卡尔曼滤波器是一种 g-h 滤波器的形式。</span></p><p>在 g-h 过滤器（g-h Filter）中，<span><strong><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span> 和 <span><strong><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span> 是两个关键的<strong>比例缩放因子（Scaling Factors）</strong>，用来决定滤波器在更新时 <strong>多大程度上信任“实际测量值”，多大程度上信任“模型预测值”</strong>。</p><hr><p>g-h 过滤器（在工程中也常被称为 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alpha_beta_filter\">Alpha-Beta 滤波器</a>）有着非常清晰且标准的递推理论公式。它在每个时间步长 <span><span data-tex=\"\\Delta t\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 内，主要包含预测（Prediction）<strong>与</strong>更新（Update）两个阶段。</p><p><strong>假设状态变量</strong>：</p><ul><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"x_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>：在时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的状态估计值（如位置、体重等）</p></li><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"v_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>：在时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 的状态变化率（如速度、每日体重增加量等）</p></li><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"z_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>：在时刻 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 来自传感器的实际测量值</p></li></ul><hr><h3>1. 预测阶段（Prediction Step）</h3><p>根据上一个时刻的状态 <span><span data-tex=\"x_{k-1}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 和变化率 <span><span data-tex=\"v_{k-1}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，利用物理模型对当前时刻进行外推预测：</p><ul><li><p><strong>状态预测值</strong>：</p><div data-tex=\"\\bar{x}_k = x_{k-1} + v_{k-1} \\cdot \\Delta t\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div></li><li><p><strong>变化率预测值</strong>：</p><div data-tex=\"\\bar{v}_k = v_{k-1}\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div></li></ul><hr><h3>2. 残差计算（Residual）</h3><p>获取传感器测量的实际值 <span><span data-tex=\"z_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，计算其实际测量值与预测值之间的差距：</p><ul><li><p><strong>残差（测量残差）</strong>：</p><div data-tex=\"y_k = z_k - \\bar{x}_k\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div></li></ul><hr><h3>3. 更新/修正阶段（Update Step）</h3><p>利用残差 <span><span data-tex=\"y_k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 以及固定的比例系数 <span><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 和 <span><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，对预测值进行加权修正：</p><ul><li><p><strong>更新状态估计值</strong>：</p><div data-tex=\"x_k = \\bar{x}_k + g \\cdot y_k = \\bar{x}_k + g \\cdot (z_k - \\bar{x}_k)\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div></li><li><p><strong>更新变化率估计值</strong>：</p><div data-tex=\"v_k = \\bar{v}_k + h \\cdot \\frac{y_k}{\\Delta t} = v_k = \\bar{v}_k + h \\cdot \\frac{z_k - \\bar{x}_k}{\\Delta t}\" data-type=\"math-block\" class=\"math-node math-block\"></div></li></ul><hr><h3>符号对应说明</h3><p>在不同的文献与领域中，g-h 过滤器的参数符号可能略有差别，但数学本质完全相同：</p><ul><li><p><strong>g-h 表达法</strong>：使用缩放因子 <span><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（修正状态）与 <span><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（修正变化率）。</p></li><li><p><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>-</strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\beta\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 表达法</strong>：在雷达跟踪和信号处理中，常将 <span><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 写作 <span><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>，将 <span><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 写作 <span><span data-tex=\"\\beta\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>。</p></li><li><p><strong>扩展（g-h-k / </strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\alpha\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>-</strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\beta\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>-</strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"\\gamma\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>）</strong>：若系统包含加速度（二次变化率），则会引入第三个因子 <span><span data-tex=\"k\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>（或 <span><span data-tex=\"\\gamma\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>）。</p></li></ul><p>它们的具体含义和作用如下：</p><ul><li><p><span><strong><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>（用于更新“位置/状态”估计）</strong>：</p><ul><li><p><strong>含义</strong>：测量值与预测值之间差值（即<strong>残差 Residual</strong>）的调整比例。</p></li><li><p><strong>作用</strong>：控制当前时刻的最佳估计值向实际测量值靠拢的程度。</p></li><li><p><strong>影响</strong>：<span><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 越大，过滤器越信任传感器的<strong>测量数据</strong>，响应越敏感，但抗噪声能力越弱；<span><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 越小，过滤器越信任<strong>预测数据</strong>，结果越平滑，但反应会变迟钝。</p></li></ul></li><li><p><span><strong><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong>（用于更新“变化率/速度”估计）</strong>：</p><ul><li><p><strong>含义</strong>：利用残差来调整系统变化率（例如每天体重增加量、物体的速度等）的比例。</p></li><li><p><strong>作用</strong>：通过本次测量的误差，来修正对未来变化趋势（速度/斜率）的估计。</p></li><li><p><strong>影响</strong>：<span><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 决定了系统跟踪变化趋势快慢的能力。如果系统正在加速或趋势发生改变，较合适的 <span><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 值能让过滤器快速跟上新的变化率。</p></li></ul></li></ul><p><strong>核心公式关系</strong>：</p><ul><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"\\text{当前估计值} = \\text{预测值} + g \\cdot (\\text{测量值} - \\text{预测值})\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span data-tex=\"\\text{新的变化率} = \\text{旧的变化率} + h \\cdot \\frac{\\text{测量值} - \\text{预测值}}{\\Delta t}\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span></p></li></ul><p>简单来说，<span><strong><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 负责调整“现在在哪里”（当前状态），</strong><span><strong><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></strong></span><strong> 负责调整“跑得有多快”（变化趋势）</strong>。各种复杂的滤波器（如卡尔曼滤波器）的核心，实际上就是在每个时间节点根据噪声情况自动计算出最优的 <span><span data-tex=\"g\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span> 和 <span><span data-tex=\"h\" data-type=\"math-inline\" class=\"math-node math-inline\"></span></span>。</p>"
}